# FastAPI Backend Rules

- Use HTTPException with proper status codes for error handling
- Prefer async functions for I/O operations
- Use Pydantic models for request/response validation
- Implement proper dependency injection patterns
- Use structured logging with request ID tracking (snowflake pattern)
- Follow the existing middleware pattern for settings refresh
